# Internal review docs (kept local; not for public archive).
# This repository IS the public reproducibility archive cited in the paper and
# deposited at Zenodo, so anything tracked here becomes public. Keep out review
# notes, revision plans, compliance audits, and the cover letter, which names
# suggested referees and is confidential editorial correspondence.
# (use docs/* not docs/ : git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded)
docs/*
# Exceptions: reporting deliverables that Nature publishes alongside the paper
# and that belong in the reproducibility record.
!docs/reporting_summary_filled.md
!docs/tripod_checklist.md
literature/

# Design-handoff snapshots. These are point-in-time COPIES of figures and
# figure code prepared for an external designer, not sources of truth. They go
# stale as soon as the pipeline changes (the 2026-07-30 bundle still carries the
# rank-biserial Fig 2 apparatus reverted in 21c0724, and a pre-truncation
# compute_hrs), so tracking them creates a second, divergent copy of live code.
# Regenerate before sending; never commit.
figures/claude_design_handoff/
figures/claude_design_handoff.zip
# Local preview byproducts of code/util_fig2_standalone.R
figures/standalone_preview/*-1.png
figures/standalone_preview/fig_treated_context_preview.pdf

# Python bytecode from the prose-pass utilities in code/
__pycache__/
